
~ start

match GameState.chair_broken
	when false
		VINCENT: This stair looks almost as unstable as you. (smug)
		PLUM: Huh? (serious)
		VINCENT: Adult joke. Don't worry about it.
		PLUM: Pervert! (angry)

		- Climb on it
			Before you can even step on it, the chair collapses.
			PLUM: Sorry...(sad)
			$> GameState.collect_broken_chair_part()
			$> hide_node("Sprite2D")
			$> show_node("Sprite2D2")
			The broken chair part was added to your items.
			=> END

		- Leave it alone
			You decide not to bother the chair.
			=> END

	else
		PLUM: Poor chair.(sad)
		=> END
